text:
The opening of #v $JAP$#! has unleashed forces beyond the control of the ruling #b Shogunate#!. Enraged by the encroachment of predatory foreign powers, militants of the [SelectLocalization(SCOPE.sPoliticalMovement('meiji_movement_scope').IsValid, SCOPE.sPoliticalMovement('meiji_movement_scope').GetName, 'movement_meiji_restorationist_name')] demand the deposition of the $RULER_TITLE_SHOGUN$, restoration of the power of the #b $RULER_TITLE_EMPEROR$#!, and the expulsion of foreigners. All the while, ambitious [SCOPE.gsInterestGroup('daimyo_ig').GetName] seek to use the weakness of the Shogunate to advance their own interests.

If Japan is to find a place in the world, she must realize the reform necessary to defend herself, and settle the conflict between her de jure and de facto sovereigns. Whether alone or alongside the Shōgun, the Emperor must rule.

@warning! As the [Concept('concept_activism', '$concept_activism_short$')] of the [SelectLocalization(SCOPE.sPoliticalMovement('meiji_movement_scope').IsValid, SCOPE.sPoliticalMovement('meiji_movement_scope').GetName, 'movement_meiji_restorationist_name')] increases, factions loyal to the Imperial Court will seek more forceful means to restore the Emperor.
